    "text": "Mechanism of a hypothetical reaction<br />\r<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>+</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>Y</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mtext>2XY</mtext></math> is given below<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></math> (fast)<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇌</mo><mtext>XY</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math> (slow)<br />\r<math><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>→</mo><mtext>XY</mtext></math> (fast)<br />\rThe overall order of the reaction will be"
